    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "WUNITEDFIRST\nrelax",
      "main event\nChoose one of the\nfollowing signature entrées:\ni Filet Mignon\nChoice filet mignon finished with rich Bordeaux wine\nsauce and sauteed mushrooms, accompanied by a\nwedge of potato and Asiago pie, and tender green beans\nand carrots.\nMushroom \u0026 Cream Cheese Pasta\nTender mushroom and cream cheese-stuffed pasta\nenvelopes topped with sautéed mushrooms, leeks and\ncherry tomatoes.\nSea Bass\nSea bass steamed with fragrant shiitake mushrooms,\naccompanied by fluffy steamed rice and Asian green\nvegetables, stir-fried with oyster sauce.\nuplift\nLight Choice Entrée designed for the health-conscious traveler\n3 trawler fil united Executive Chef selection Anytime \u0026\nAnytime à-la-carte in-flight snack\nWashoku Zen Selection*\nOur Washoku Zen selection is a collection of artfully\nprepared Japanese dishes served in two courses:\nCOURSE ONE\nStart with bite-sized portions of salmon sushi with\nfish eggs, roasted lime-flavored beef with miso,\nquick-blanched tuna, broiled salmon, sansho-\nflavored sweet smelt, seaweed-flavored flounder\nand somen noodles topped with egg.\nCOURSE TWO\nContinue with braised pork kakuni with sautéed\nonions, white leek julienne, green bean and carrot\nflower, steamed rice and Japanese-pickled\nvegetables to finish this bento box-style meal.\nAccompanied by soothing green tea.\n*Items in this meal may contain MSG.\nTo ensure avalability on tuture ments to\nand from Japan, request the Japanese\nmeal on united.com, or by contacting\nUnited Reservations at least 24 hours\noner debarture."
    ],
